  * VSIF_PERCENTAGES): 1, 5, 10, 25, 50, 75, 90, 95 and 99 percent, the last one made at 99.98 percent (ST 2094-40
- * 8.5.3, as dvbridge_hdr10plus.h reads it). Every place carries its percentile, measured, in application version 1
